tional Markdown registry</summary><p>Active source: Rules.md. The settings profile is retained but dormant. A missing or changed file never silently falls back to it.</p><p role=\"status\" data-org-registry=\"ready\">Registry state: validated</p><label>Vault-relative Markdown path<input data-org-field=\"registry-path\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"org-path\" type=\"text\"></label><button type=\"button\" data-org-action=\"registry-connect\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"org-registry-connect\">Read and review existing file</button><button type=\"button\" data-org-action=\"registry-edit\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"org-registry-edit\">Edit definitions with Review</button><button type=\"button\" data-org-action=\"registry-disconnect\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"org-registry-disconnect\">Review disconnection</button><details><summary>Create a new registry</summary><label>Complete new document (editable)<textarea rows=\"12\" data-org-field=\"registry-content\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"org-content\"></textarea></label><button type=\"button\" data-org-action=\"registry-create\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"org-registry-create\">Preview creation</button></details></details><fieldset disabled=\"\"><p>Definitions come from the selected file. Editing the settings copy is disabled. Use the registry editor above, or edit the file yourself and read/review it again; disconnection is separate.</p><legend>Category rules</legend><p>Confirmed profile loaded. Edits below remain a draft until saved.</p><p>Categories are independent dimensions, not a single tag chain. One primary value is a preference allowing exceptions. Document structure (moc, atom) is separate from content role.</p><button type=\"button\" data-taxonomy-action=\"add\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"add\">Add category</button><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Rules match the saved profile; there are no new changes.</p><button type=\"button\" data-taxonomy-action=\"review\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"review\" disabled=\"\">Review changes</button><button type=\"button\" data-taxonomy-action=\"reload\" data-taxonomy-focus=\"reload\">Discard draft and reload saved rules</button></fieldset></details></div></div>",
